EmbeddingGemma 2 (Google)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The app's optional natural-language search feature downloads Google's
EmbeddingGemma 2 model at the user's request and runs it on-device to convert
search queries into vectors. The model file is distributed unmodified: the
ggml-org Q8_0 GGUF build of google/embeddinggemma-2
(embeddinggemma-2-Q8_0.gguf, 309,855,456 bytes, SHA-256
2188ac1deca4b77dffefd603c2776a9d76d9d74ec01841392982ebb840b09135). The model
weights are never committed to this repository.

EmbeddingGemma 2 is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0); see
https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2. Neither the model's repository
nor the GGUF's carries a NOTICE file.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llama.cpp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The same feature embeds llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp) to
run the model.

